Package: xfce4-settings
Version: @DEB_XFCE4SETTINGS_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: System
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/start
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-3-0, libxfce4util7, libxfce4ui-2-0, libexo-2-0, libgarcon-1-0, xfconf, libx11-6, libxi6, libxrandr2, libxcursor1
Description: Settings manager for the Xfce desktop environment
 The Xfce settings manager plus the xfsettingsd daemon, which apply theme, font,
 DPI, display (xrandr), mouse and keyboard configuration stored in xfconf.
